assets/real-portfolio/

# --- Brand research archive (third-party content, kept on disk for our research only, never republished) ---
# We commit only our derived analysis (meta.json, products.json, notes.md, sources.md, pages.json, pdfs.json).
# Raw HTML caches and downloaded TDS PDFs stay local — they are third-party copyrighted material.
data/brands/*/_raw_*.html
data/brands/*/tds/
3d-assets/textures-v4-orig/
